# WR-04: never let a LOCAL `docker build` bake local secrets or
# local-only trees into a pushed image layer (CI builds from a clean
# checkout, but D-10 explicitly blesses local builds). scripts/team/data
# holds the gitignored team-keys.json ("Team channel secrets" per
# .gitignore) on the maintainer's machine; nothing committed lives there.
